{
  "name": "unify-graph-project-relative-paths",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T16:10:52.623Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T14:47:14.268Z",
  "description": "Unifies code-graph results to consistently expose projectRelativePath across symbols, files, documents, hotspots, and impact analyses while eliminating legacy configRelativePath, displayPath, and displayTargets. Upgrades SQLite store schema to version 14 with zero-join denormalized paths backed by ADR-0028. Introduces host-agnostic SDK orchestrators in @specd/sdk to decouple presentation from graph operations.",
